# Pehle Amphoteric k liye check karna h phir neutral k liye phir aage :)

Amphoteric oxides :
Zn Sn Be Al Pb Ga Cd   -->   All oxides are amphoteric in nature
As^3+ Fe^3+ Sb^3+ Cr^3+ V^5+ Te^4+     --> oxides are amphoteric only in these oxidation states

Neutral oxides :
CO NO N2O   --> Only these three oxides are neutral in nature

Metal oxides :
                                   {Oxidation state}    {Nature}
                                |----(+1, +2, +3) --------- Basic
Metals(d-block)  ---|-----(+4)              --------- Amphoteric
                                |----(+5, +6, +7) --------- Acidic

Acidic oxides :
All non-metal, metalloid oxides are acidic {par pehle amphoteric check kar lena}
